{%- comment -%}
  Maps a French colour option value to a hex swatch.
  Kept as a snippet so the catalogue and the theme editor never drift apart.
  An unknown value falls back to the sand surface rather than rendering black.

  Accepts:
  - value {String} the option value, e.g. "Vert sauge"
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case value -%}
  {%- when 'Vert sauge' -%}#6E7F6B
  {%- when 'Gris ardoise' -%}#5A6169
  {%- when 'Rose argile' -%}#C89A8E
  {%- when 'Noir' -%}#1C1C1A
  {%- when 'Bleu ciel' -%}#A8C4D8
  {%- when 'Bleu' -%}#4A7BA7
  {%- when 'Vert' -%}#5B8C5A
  {%- when 'Rose' -%}#D98BA5
  {%- when 'Rouge' -%}#B3413A
  {%- when 'Jaune' -%}#E0B450
  {%- else -%}#EDE6DA
{%- endcase -%}
